    "identifier": "shadow-rush",
    "description": "<p>You cloak yourself in a dark aura meant to accelerate your movement. You make a Dash towards your target creature in range, attempting to stab them first as you impact them then using their body as a Launch pad, jumping into the air directly after.</p>\n<p>First, move up to 60 feet in any direction towards a creature you can see within range, ending your movement within 5 feet of them. Next, make a melee taijutsu attack against the target creature, on a hit the target takes your weapons damage + 4d4.</p>",
